6. Addendum,

Lasting Grievances8

i. 	The history of the present Myth Community is a history of repeated degeneracy 
and immaturity, all of which have as their direct object the result of a fractured state of 
the community. To best represent the repeated essence of this community, let these 
observations be submitted to those observing, illustrating a harrowing architecture.

- The community is made by children, for children, and is of children, whether physically or mentally

- It is a faceless community; being identifiable outside of Roblox avatars would 
push people away from perversion or degeneracy

- Attacks on community members take place out of immaturity and falsehood, 
much more than on those who deserve it

- Punishment is virtually impossible, or outright does not happen

- It is not clear enough that you can and should communicate with higher ranks

- Many push reality upon this community; their politics and ideologies are 
taken into this community, where it has no place

- There is no real presence off-platform, or anywhere outside of the community 
itself beyond small YouTube channels and Discord servers

- Whether due to a lack of confidence or engaging community, not many are here for long

- The community generally depends on Discord, most visible for larger groups, 
which is known as a platform lacking competent control over the perverse

- This community has no solid center; the many groups and discords are 
the fractured manifestation of this

- Groups and discords themselves are generally distracted and do not have the 
community in mind

- There is no real discussion on definitions, meaning, or what the community is 
and should be

- There is no agreeable basis of quality for myths, groups, or hunters

- Our ineptitude for communication hinders new ideas in the community, 
resulting in a lack of community consciousness

